      "content": "\"being done trying\"... that's almost what i've been thinking. like, if the play is over and the audience is gone, why am i still standing on this empty stage? it just feels like such a heavy, pointless burden to keep dragging this body around when there's nothing left inside. do you think it's wrong to just... want to stop? to just stop the struggle entirely?",
